  Every selection computes `output_hash` before changing the selected base's `model_id` and adding `selection_receipt`, so it does not identify the returned output. Independently hashing `selection$base` fails for all five delivered acceptance artifacts. Finalize the model identity before hashing and explicitly define a canonical payload that excludes the self-referential receipt hash; add a regression check that reproduces that identity from the returned base. This matters for the mandatory machine-readable receipt and independent replay requirements in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md#L123-L125).
